Only past events from this request's principal count.

@id("alert_same_principal_login_and_transfer")
PERMIT any principal to perform Alert on any resource
  when:
    for some callerPrincipal pr:
      a Login request with callerPrincipal = pr occurred within the last 1 hour
      and a Transfer request with callerPrincipal = pr occurred within the last 1 hour
